WEBVTT

00:06:59.438 --> 00:07:02.000
but I think the way
many of us are using technology

00:07:02.024 --> 00:07:03.796
either isolates us from other people

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:07.613
or reduces the quality
of our interaction with people,

00:07:07.637 --> 00:07:11.613
either by distracting us or substituting
lower-quality online connections

00:07:11.637 --> 00:07:14.866
for what used to be
higher-quality offline connections.

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:17.090
And I think that that
comes at a real price.

00:07:18.022 --> 00:07:19.535
AG: If you're like most people,

00:07:19.559 --> 00:07:22.021
you've probably felt
a heightened sense of isolation

00:07:22.045 --> 00:07:23.864
from your colleagues or your clients.

00:07:23.888 --> 00:07:26.456
Maybe you've even found
yourself missing your boss.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.346
Loneliness isn't just
an unpleasant feeling.

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:31.216
It's also bad for business.